  "explanation": "The question asks \"When was the Poplar station opened?\" and the sources distinguish multiple distinct Poplar stations over time:\n\n1. **Poplar (East India Road) railway station** was opened in **1866** by the North London Railway (D1S2) and also specified as **1.8.1866** (D2S1).\n2. **Poplar railway station** (on Brunswick Street) was opened on **6 July 1840** by the Commercial Railway (D3S3, D4S2).\n3. **Poplar DLR station**, a modern Docklands Light Railway station, was opened on **21 August 1987** (D5S5, D6S2).\n\nEach of these is a distinct station with its own opening date. The audit confirms direct support for each from their respective documents. There is no conflict among them because they refer to different entities."
}
